msgid ""
"On a :term:`free threaded <free threading>` build, this checks if "
"*op*'s :term:`reference count` is equal to one and additionally checks if "
"*op* is only used by this thread. :c:expr:`Py_REFCNT(op) == 1` is **not** "
"thread-safe on free threaded builds; prefer this function."
